---
title: Sparkling Peach Margarita
tags: [orange liqueur, peach liqueur, tequila]
course: Cocktails
servings: 4
prep time: 1 minute
cook time: 1 minute
image: https://www.mybakingaddiction.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Peach-Margarita-Image.jpg
source: https://www.mybakingaddiction.com/sparkling-peach-margaritas/
---

= Instructions

Place the sliced, pitted, and peeled @Peaches{4}, granulated @Sugar{2 tablespoons}, and @Lime juice{1 lime} in a blender and 
blend until smooth.

Transfer the peach puree to a large #Cocktail shaker{} and add in @Exotico Blanco Tequila{8 oz}, 
@Peach liqueur{4 oz}, and @Triple sec{2 oz}. Add in some @Ice{} and shake vigorously for about ~{15 seconds}.

Rub a @Lime wedge{} along the rims of 4 #Rocks glasses{} and and invert each glass into a small dish of @Coarse sugar{}.

Add @Ice{} cubes to each glass.

Divide the mixture between the 4 glasses and top off each cocktail with @Mountain Valley White Peach Sparkling Water{}.

Garnish with sliced @Peaches{} and a @Lime wedge{}.